    "id": "M21",
    "title_zh": "知识与生活：相连的哲学候选",
    "title_en": "Knowing and living: connected philosophical proposal",
    "claim_zh": "认识的内容、根据、错误、标准与模型修订已形成相连候选；G0 与公开 J1–J4/E 说明其生活意义。科学哲学若要充分解释认识活动，须保存使证据与纠正成立的实际依存；这支持对已确立生成关系的有范围相容要求，不等于接受整套理论。",
    "claim_en": "Content, grounds, error, standards and model revision form a connected account of knowing; G0 and explicit J1–J4/E explain its place in living. Adequate philosophies of inquiry must preserve the actual dependencies of evidence and correction, supporting scoped compatibility with established generative content without requiring endorsement of the entire theory.",
    "scope_zh": "必要性路线直接评估完成，整套理论必要性仍未证。新增13项 Lean 定理／18项空依赖审计，区分兼容、接受与真实；全观点定理的单例与适用域前提公开。保留已完成模型修订30／72及76次执行、来源26／53、选择性修订16／32和四项统计量复核的原范围。原典对手保留，G0公理路线不重开；无新实验或独立验收，普遍语义与意识仍开放。",
    "scope_en": "Necessity routes assessed; whole-theory necessity remains unproved. 13 new Lean theorems/18 empty dependency audits distinguish compatibility, acceptance and correctness, disclosing singleton and domain premises of the all-views result. Prior model revision 30/72 and 76 runs, source reliance 26/53, selective revision 16/32 and four-statistic checks retain their scopes. Primary rivals remain; the G0 axiom route is not reopened. No new experiment or independent acceptance; universal semantics and consciousness remain open.",
